ORION Phase 10D Operational Workflows
Purpose

This document defines the official operator workflows implemented during Phase 10D.

These workflows describe how a user interacts with ORION from the first uploaded image to the completed simulated mission.

They represent the reference operational flow for demonstrations, validation sessions, and investor presentations.

