Workflow Principles

Every workflow follows the same philosophy:

One clear direction from left to right.
No hidden operator decisions.
No business logic in the UI.
Every action becomes an Intent.
The Digital Twin remains the only runtime source of truth.
The UI never performs planning, optimization, scheduling, or resource allocation.
